  "contentHtml": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\">대전, 대구, 경기 과학샘 원격연수 추천(중학교에 더욱 적당)</span><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><a href=\"http://www.tschool.net/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"outer_link word_break\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; word-wrap: break-word; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(54, 195, 103);\">http://www.tschool.net</a><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\">에 있는<b><u> '내공팍팍! 과학수업 전문가 과정'</u></b></span><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\">이름만 그럴싸하게 붙여 놓은 걸거라 생각했는데, 듣다보니 괜찮아요.</span></p><p>(강사가 누군지 알려주면 많이 들을텐데.. ^^)</p><p><br><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\">30차시 중 10차시 들었는데,&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\">눈이즐거운물리 김상협샘께서&nbsp;에버노트 강의해주시고,</span><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\">김정식샘께서&nbsp;구글문서 사용법, 스마트기기, 마술활용, 음식활용 수업 강의 해주시네요.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\">알고 있는 내용이 있어도 괜찮아요.(저는 공짜라..ㅎ 교육청에서 단체신청)</span><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\">지금 교육청단체신청가능한 곳은 대전, 대구, 경기네요.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', N